WEBVTT

00:00.680 --> 00:03.480
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.480 --> 00:06.070
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.740 --> 00:10.140
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.840 --> 00:14.850
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.220 --> 00:17.750
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.090 --> 00:21.530
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.280 --> 00:28.500
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.180 --> 00:34.260
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.060 --> 00:37.550
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.550 --> 00:40.160
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.680 --> 00:47.940
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.910 --> 00:51.670
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.730 --> 00:54.570
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.860 --> 00:55.890
♪Let me♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.160
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.610 --> 01:03.290
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.580 --> 01:06.280
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.450 --> 01:07.920
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.920 --> 01:12.090
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.450 --> 01:22.700
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.130 --> 01:29.680
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.880 --> 01:31.740
(Xianchang Academy)

01:31.850 --> 01:32.530
Today

01:33.410 --> 01:35.530
(Year 14 of Qingyuan, Wei, Xianchang Academy)
marks your first enrollment.

01:36.050 --> 01:36.810
I know

01:37.610 --> 01:39.009
you come from privileged families

01:39.810 --> 01:42.610
and have lived in comfort till now.

01:43.770 --> 01:44.890
But at Xianchang Academy,

01:45.610 --> 01:47.650
you must study diligently

01:47.850 --> 01:48.810
day and night

01:49.250 --> 01:51.210
to refine your talents
through perseverance

01:51.970 --> 01:53.170
and serve our nation well.

01:54.759 --> 01:57.330
(Master Wei,
Scholar of Xianchang Academy)

01:57.330 --> 01:58.170
Young man,

01:58.650 --> 01:59.610
what's your name?

02:00.130 --> 02:01.530
Why do you keep wearing a mask?

02:02.250 --> 02:04.850
Constantly hiding your true appearance

02:05.370 --> 02:06.770
is rather rude, don't you think?

02:11.650 --> 02:12.290
Master,

02:12.730 --> 02:13.890
I am He Rufei.

02:14.770 --> 02:16.530
My visage is unsightly,

02:16.970 --> 02:18.290
and I fear startling others.

02:18.730 --> 02:20.329
So I cannot remove this mask.

02:27.810 --> 02:29.090
He's the Xiaos' second son?

02:29.890 --> 02:31.130
His exceptionalness lives up

02:31.290 --> 02:32.170
to his reputation!

02:32.650 --> 02:33.329
Indeed.

02:41.290 --> 02:43.010
I, Xiao Jue, apologize for being late.

02:43.650 --> 02:44.610
Please forgive me.

02:47.720 --> 02:50.740
=Episode 2=

03:16.460 --> 03:17.850
(Cheng Lisu,
Imperial Medical Bureau's Top Disciple)

03:17.850 --> 03:18.930
The army doesn't tolerate

03:18.970 --> 03:20.090
flashy things,

03:21.210 --> 03:21.770
including you.

03:28.010 --> 03:29.450
I traveled so far to join you.

03:29.730 --> 03:30.650
You treat me like this?

03:31.050 --> 03:32.890
You can go back
for your arranged marriage.

03:34.850 --> 03:35.770
If I could beat you,

03:36.210 --> 03:36.770
I'd have...

03:38.450 --> 03:39.410
beaten you senseless.

03:40.970 --> 03:43.250
Feinu, escort Mr. Cheng out.

03:44.890 --> 03:45.430
Understood.

03:46.410 --> 03:47.050
Would you really

03:47.050 --> 03:47.930
abandon your friend

03:47.930 --> 03:48.730
in need?

03:49.290 --> 03:50.210
Avoiding marriage

03:51.170 --> 03:51.890
won't kill you.

03:53.210 --> 03:54.329
At worst, they'll maim you.

03:54.650 --> 03:55.250
Xiao Jue.

03:55.890 --> 03:56.410
Commander.

03:58.290 --> 03:59.210
Uncle.

04:00.090 --> 04:01.170
We're about the same age.

04:01.530 --> 04:03.090
But you're still my maternal uncle.

04:03.490 --> 04:04.490
Please let me stay.

04:05.530 --> 04:06.170
Okay?

04:15.410 --> 04:15.970
Thank you.

04:32.730 --> 04:34.370
(If you enlist as a woman,)

04:34.850 --> 04:36.010
(it will remain a liability.)

04:36.850 --> 04:37.690
(So I have prepared)

04:38.010 --> 04:38.650
(for you)

04:38.690 --> 04:39.850
(male identity papers)

04:40.330 --> 04:41.210
(of He Yan.)

04:43.860 --> 04:46.010
(He Yan's Household Register)

04:46.010 --> 04:46.890
You're He Yan, right?

04:48.730 --> 04:49.770
(Two names are different)

04:50.170 --> 04:50.930
(in one character.)

04:51.770 --> 04:53.250
(Master's foresight is thoughtful.)

04:54.370 --> 04:55.690
To the left tent for screening.

04:56.130 --> 04:57.530
Then to the right tent if you pass

04:57.570 --> 04:58.210
to register

04:58.370 --> 04:59.290
for uniforms and money.

05:00.020 --> 05:00.730
Thank you.

05:00.890 --> 05:01.450
Next.

05:03.610 --> 05:05.050
Commander, what's screening?

05:05.810 --> 05:06.970
Don't know what screening is?

05:07.450 --> 05:08.010
It's simple.

05:08.410 --> 05:09.850
Strip naked for the medic's exam.

05:10.330 --> 05:11.090
If you're healthy,

05:11.130 --> 05:11.730
you'll pass.

05:12.490 --> 05:13.610
- Thanks.
- Next.

05:19.530 --> 05:20.730
The Gaoxia horse struggles

05:21.170 --> 05:22.210
with the climate.

05:22.810 --> 05:23.770
It hasn't eaten.

05:24.570 --> 05:25.210
Examine it.

05:25.610 --> 05:26.450
See what ails it.

05:26.810 --> 05:27.330
What?

05:28.170 --> 05:29.570
I, a future imperial physician,

05:29.610 --> 05:30.570
am treating a horse?

05:30.810 --> 05:31.810
As a healer,

05:32.409 --> 05:33.970
shouldn't you treat all lives equally?

05:34.930 --> 05:37.250
Besides, Yezhou Garrison
keeps no idlers.

05:37.810 --> 05:38.610
If you want to stay,

05:39.770 --> 05:40.490
be useful.

05:50.450 --> 05:51.570
Fortunately, this is a mare.

05:52.090 --> 05:53.330
Helping it is acceptable.

05:53.770 --> 05:54.570
I'd have declined

05:54.690 --> 05:55.690
if it were a stallion.

05:56.850 --> 05:58.370
Xiao Jue, watch closely.

05:58.850 --> 05:59.730
I can both heal

05:59.970 --> 06:00.810
and tame horses.

06:14.290 --> 06:14.930
Look!

06:15.410 --> 06:16.250
It's spooked!

06:16.650 --> 06:17.250
It's coming!

06:30.650 --> 06:31.290
Make way!

06:31.650 --> 06:32.409
Move aside! Move!

06:35.050 --> 06:35.650
Move aside!

07:20.130 --> 07:21.330
That man's way of taming

07:22.530 --> 07:23.890
is unique to the Fuyue Army.

07:24.650 --> 07:25.650
He's He Rufei's man?

07:29.490 --> 07:31.290
(No, I accidentally gave myself away.)

07:31.810 --> 07:32.810
(Xiao Jue noticed it.)

07:33.690 --> 07:34.210
Not bad.

07:34.690 --> 07:36.170
He resembles my heroics in the past.

07:39.610 --> 07:40.770
That move he just pulled

07:41.650 --> 07:42.810
is way beyond your skills.

08:03.250 --> 08:03.770
(Oh no.)

08:04.450 --> 08:05.930
(Xiao Jue knows Fuyue Army's moves.)

08:06.770 --> 08:07.970
(He definitely recognized it.)

08:08.330 --> 08:09.330
(Yet he didn't react.)

08:10.850 --> 08:11.410
(He took me)

08:11.450 --> 08:12.410
(as He Rufei's man)

08:13.170 --> 08:14.490
(and planned to act against me?)

08:17.890 --> 08:18.410
Come on.

08:18.650 --> 08:19.290
Let's continue.

08:20.450 --> 08:21.050
Gather around!

08:25.770 --> 08:26.410
Impressive.

08:26.810 --> 08:27.450
You're small.

08:27.490 --> 08:28.410
But you're quite good.

08:28.650 --> 08:29.290
You flatter me.

08:29.650 --> 08:30.730
My taming skills could

08:30.930 --> 08:32.289
never match yours, Instructor.

08:33.820 --> 08:34.490
Well...

08:36.130 --> 08:36.890
The army needs

08:36.890 --> 08:37.770
talents like you.

08:39.370 --> 08:40.049
But

08:40.770 --> 08:41.970
I haven't been screened yet.

08:42.210 --> 08:42.970
Forget about it.

08:43.169 --> 08:44.330
If you can tame such a horse,

08:44.370 --> 08:45.610
your physique must be good.

08:45.750 --> 08:46.680
I'll secure the horse.

08:46.680 --> 08:48.250
Then let's handle the documents. Wait.

08:48.650 --> 08:49.490
- Go.
- Thank you.

08:50.290 --> 08:51.130
So naughty.

08:51.450 --> 08:52.490
Turn and slash!

08:53.770 --> 08:54.690
Since you suspect him,

08:54.970 --> 08:56.010
why not kill him directly

08:56.130 --> 08:56.690
for good?

08:57.210 --> 08:58.650
If he's truly a spy sent

08:58.650 --> 08:59.610
by the ill-intended one,

09:00.170 --> 09:00.890
killing one will

09:01.570 --> 09:02.610
only bring replacements.

09:03.410 --> 09:04.930
Rather than endless trouble,

09:05.290 --> 09:06.210
it's better to keep him

09:06.930 --> 09:08.490
to potentially lure out the mastermind.

09:09.610 --> 09:10.250
I wonder

09:10.490 --> 09:11.850
whether the mastermind is He Rufei

09:11.850 --> 09:12.650
or Xu Jingfu.

09:13.250 --> 09:14.010
You said

09:14.490 --> 09:15.690
before your father's campaign,

09:16.050 --> 09:17.530
he impeached the prime minister.

09:18.450 --> 09:19.250
Within days,

09:19.490 --> 09:20.410
he fell into an ambush

09:20.530 --> 09:21.290
at Mingshui.

09:21.730 --> 09:22.810
He Rufei's troops

09:22.890 --> 09:24.090
were a hundred li away,

09:24.930 --> 09:25.690
but arrived only

09:25.730 --> 09:27.130
on day seven after your father

09:27.130 --> 09:27.930
sent the letter.

09:28.650 --> 09:29.570
It was intentional.

09:30.250 --> 09:30.770
I think

09:31.250 --> 09:32.490
they are birds of a feather.

09:33.930 --> 09:35.410
But we lack concrete evidence.

09:36.250 --> 09:37.130
We can't prove

09:37.130 --> 09:38.170
the defeat at Mingshui

09:38.450 --> 09:40.130
relates to Xu Jingfu and He Rufei.

09:40.810 --> 09:41.610
Nor can we prove

09:42.250 --> 09:43.890
their collusion.

09:45.650 --> 09:47.010
Now the Xiao Army is weakened

09:47.690 --> 09:48.810
and disliked by His Majesty.

09:49.690 --> 09:51.050
We can only investigate covertly.

09:52.050 --> 09:53.210
With troop shortages here

09:53.210 --> 09:54.050
and low funds,

09:55.250 --> 09:56.650
building a competent new army

09:57.650 --> 09:58.530
is highly challenging.

10:04.370 --> 10:05.930
Investigate that man thoroughly.

10:06.570 --> 10:07.490
I want to know

10:07.650 --> 10:08.530
whose pawn he is.

10:09.770 --> 10:10.530
Understood.

10:13.390 --> 10:15.600
(Xu Mansion)

10:32.430 --> 10:35.480
(Chu Zhao, Disciple of Xu Jingfu)

10:44.450 --> 10:45.300
Master.

10:47.130 --> 10:48.410
Regarding the Que City mission,

10:49.250 --> 10:50.410
you've worked hard.

10:51.890 --> 10:52.570
As ordered,

10:53.210 --> 10:54.570
I monitored Xiao Jue in Que City.

10:55.290 --> 10:56.570
The battle was unwinnable,

10:57.170 --> 10:58.170
yet no one anticipated

10:58.450 --> 10:59.530
his ruthless tactic

10:59.650 --> 11:00.810
of flooding Que City

11:01.130 --> 11:02.370
to force a reversal.

11:03.410 --> 11:04.050
Pity

11:05.850 --> 11:07.410
those countless lost souls.

11:09.090 --> 11:09.650
Zilan,

11:09.890 --> 11:11.170
ensure that Xiao Jue's

11:11.330 --> 11:12.810
flooding of Que City

11:13.050 --> 11:15.930
and mass slaughter of tens of thousands

11:16.650 --> 11:18.010
are publicly exposed

11:18.250 --> 11:21.090
to expose his infamy to the world.

11:21.370 --> 11:22.530
His Majesty's wariness

11:23.090 --> 11:25.250
toward him will grow even deeper.

11:28.370 --> 11:29.490
Though victorious,

11:30.050 --> 11:31.930
he was promoted in name
but demoted in reality.

11:32.570 --> 11:34.210
He was sent to Yezhou Garrison.

11:34.610 --> 11:37.570
Even with his conscription rights
restored,

11:37.690 --> 11:39.330
that desolate wasteland

11:39.490 --> 11:41.530
could never yield decent soldiers.

11:42.450 --> 11:43.090
Moreover,

11:43.930 --> 11:45.050
I discovered in Que City

11:45.650 --> 11:47.090
a fish that slipped through the net.

11:49.050 --> 11:50.850
I've positioned him as a hidden pawn

11:51.050 --> 11:51.850
in our strategy.

11:52.170 --> 11:53.010
Given time,

11:53.450 --> 11:55.770
he'll become an unstoppable vanguard.

11:58.050 --> 11:58.730
Great.

11:59.010 --> 12:01.250
Focus on recovering these coming days.

12:01.930 --> 12:02.650
Soon,

12:03.090 --> 12:04.770
you'll be entrusted

12:04.810 --> 12:05.610
with greater tasks.

12:05.890 --> 12:06.650
Understood.

12:07.490 --> 12:08.010
Chu Zhao.

12:14.290 --> 12:16.890
(Xu Pingting, Daughter of Xu Jingfu)
You're back! Did you bring me a gift?

12:18.970 --> 12:20.730
Your impudence grows by the day.

12:21.570 --> 12:22.260
Father.

12:23.570 --> 12:24.370
I'd never forget.

12:30.650 --> 12:31.570
What fragrance is this?

12:32.250 --> 12:33.090
Try it to find out.

12:34.010 --> 12:34.890
Try it with me.

12:38.210 --> 12:38.970
Go ahead.

12:40.850 --> 12:42.970
Then I'll graciously accept.

12:43.900 --> 12:44.410
Let's go.

13:01.050 --> 13:02.810
What's wrong with this tinderbox?

13:04.250 --> 13:05.010
Let me try.

13:11.730 --> 13:12.370
Stop it.

13:13.290 --> 13:14.410
Light it with the candle.

13:17.570 --> 13:19.130
Burn him! Burn him!

13:19.210 --> 13:20.170
(Burn him!)

13:33.130 --> 13:33.690
Let me see.

13:36.450 --> 13:37.170
You're injured.

13:40.730 --> 13:41.330
Are you okay?

13:42.210 --> 13:42.810
It's nothing.

13:43.970 --> 13:44.810
Just got burned.

13:45.810 --> 13:46.450
My grip slipped.

14:07.530 --> 14:08.050
Young Master,

14:08.890 --> 14:09.530
your injury...

14:16.050 --> 14:17.770
(Yingxiang, Chu Zhao's maid)
I know you wounded your left arm

14:17.810 --> 14:18.690
intentionally.

14:19.010 --> 14:19.570
But...

14:20.090 --> 14:21.250
I've failed my duties.

14:22.250 --> 14:23.650
And I was also injured by refugees.

14:24.730 --> 14:26.770
I feel ashamed, Master.

14:28.290 --> 14:29.850
You're being too harsh with yourself.

14:30.210 --> 14:31.570
To earn Master's favor,

14:34.970 --> 14:36.410
sacrifices must be made.

15:14.290 --> 15:15.290
(A bandit?)

15:15.600 --> 15:18.300
(Wang Ba, Yezhou Garrison recruit)

15:19.770 --> 15:20.490
Move!

15:21.230 --> 15:23.130
(Zheng Xuan, Yezhou Garrison recruit)

15:25.980 --> 15:27.130
(Face-tattooing punishment?)

15:27.730 --> 15:28.730
(He was a convict)

15:29.250 --> 15:29.930
(and a rogue.)

15:29.930 --> 15:30.690
Boss, your tea.

15:32.450 --> 15:33.210
Well-mannered.

15:33.930 --> 15:34.530
It's tiring.

15:39.470 --> 15:42.040
(Jiang Jiao, Yezhou Garrison recruit)

15:42.320 --> 15:44.310
(Escort Agency)

15:45.140 --> 15:46.360
(Former escort agency member?)

15:46.490 --> 15:47.450
(He must be skilled.)

15:48.290 --> 15:49.010
Look away!

15:49.570 --> 15:50.370
Pretty boy.

15:51.010 --> 15:51.770
(Paler than me.)

15:52.170 --> 15:53.210
(How dare he judge me?)

15:57.050 --> 15:57.890
I used to think

15:58.090 --> 15:59.250
(Mai, Yezhou Garrison recruit)
I was the shortest one here

15:59.450 --> 16:00.370
in the camp.

16:00.770 --> 16:01.370
But now

16:01.770 --> 16:03.010
you're almost as short as me.

16:03.650 --> 16:04.180
Alright.

16:04.530 --> 16:05.530
We together eat more

16:05.650 --> 16:06.450
to grow taller.

16:06.570 --> 16:08.970
By the way, what's your name?

16:09.370 --> 16:09.970
He Yan.

16:10.690 --> 16:13.010
Then I'll call you He.

16:13.450 --> 16:14.140
Agreed.

16:14.610 --> 16:15.370
I'm Mai.

16:16.850 --> 16:17.690
I was a farmer.

16:17.890 --> 16:18.450
Sleep here.

16:19.560 --> 16:22.100
(Huang Xiong, Yezhou Garrison recruit)

16:23.250 --> 16:24.890
(This one was a hunter.)

16:25.370 --> 16:27.610
(A killer wearing prayer beads.)

16:27.930 --> 16:28.730
(Interesting.)

16:29.610 --> 16:30.130
Thanks.

16:33.050 --> 16:33.570
He,

16:35.330 --> 16:36.770
you'll sleep here tonight.

16:37.170 --> 16:38.210
- Okay.
- Let me help.

16:38.570 --> 16:39.370
No need.

17:09.810 --> 17:12.010
You claim hostility with Xiao Jue,

17:12.329 --> 17:13.010
yet you know

17:13.450 --> 17:14.329
the Que City battle

17:14.609 --> 17:16.010
left his reputation in ruins.

17:16.450 --> 17:17.250
Aren't you afraid

17:18.450 --> 17:19.609
to be implicated by him

17:19.970 --> 17:20.770
or slandered?

17:21.650 --> 17:22.250
Master,

17:23.130 --> 17:23.849
I don't believe

17:24.410 --> 17:26.170
Xiao Jue would flood Que City

17:26.450 --> 17:27.730
just for an easy victory.

17:28.010 --> 17:28.650
Nor would he

17:29.090 --> 17:30.850
sacrifice all the people of Que City

17:31.010 --> 17:32.010
as stepping stones

17:32.610 --> 17:34.170
to pave his path to military glory.

17:35.290 --> 17:36.210
Most importantly,

17:36.570 --> 17:39.530
the Xiao Army urgently needs
new recruits right now.

17:40.650 --> 17:43.450
This way I can stand out quicker

17:44.210 --> 17:45.170
and prove myself.

17:55.890 --> 17:57.290
(The snoring chorus is impressive.)

17:57.910 --> 17:59.090
(I last heard this long ago.)

18:21.970 --> 18:22.770
He,

18:23.610 --> 18:24.490
you're up so early.

18:26.690 --> 18:27.250
Nature called.

18:32.690 --> 18:33.330
Mr. Shen.

18:34.690 --> 18:35.730
- Mr. Shen.
- Mr. Shen.

18:36.170 --> 18:39.060
(Shen Han,
Head Instructor of Yezhou Garrison)

18:47.050 --> 18:48.930
What guy...

18:50.290 --> 18:50.970
Mr. Shen.

18:57.370 --> 18:58.570
Good morning, Commander.

18:58.610 --> 18:59.330
- Good morning.
- Good morning.

18:59.330 --> 18:59.900
Good morning.

19:08.850 --> 19:09.650
Up already?

19:10.770 --> 19:12.650
He woke up
from nature's call, Commander.

19:22.090 --> 19:22.770
Everyone!

19:23.410 --> 19:24.570
Gather at the training field

19:25.130 --> 19:27.090
and have ten weighted laps
around the barracks!

19:27.810 --> 19:29.170
Not a single lap less.

19:29.610 --> 19:30.530
Wait, ten...

19:31.130 --> 19:31.810
Ten laps?

19:32.370 --> 19:33.290
Why?

19:40.930 --> 19:42.530
It was all because of you!

19:44.170 --> 19:45.610
You had to be an early riser

19:46.130 --> 19:48.290
with no team spirit!

19:48.570 --> 19:50.250
- Selfish worm!
- Yes, selfish.

19:50.770 --> 19:52.130
Go home if you want to sleep in.

19:52.730 --> 19:53.530
We're in the army.

19:54.130 --> 19:54.770
You...

19:55.610 --> 19:56.450
Boss! Boss!

19:56.610 --> 19:57.930
If you don't get out now,

19:58.010 --> 19:59.050
you'll be punished harder.

19:59.690 --> 20:00.770
Don't be mad.

20:00.970 --> 20:02.050
Stay calm.

20:05.770 --> 20:06.410
He,

20:06.810 --> 20:07.730
I'm afraid I won't

20:07.770 --> 20:08.970
keep up with the training.

20:09.210 --> 20:09.720
Don't worry.

20:10.050 --> 20:10.730
Recruit training

20:10.810 --> 20:11.730
is always gradual.

20:11.850 --> 20:12.890
Day One will be simple.

20:18.370 --> 20:19.130
I can't go on.

20:19.450 --> 20:21.010
I can't go on. I really can't.

20:26.210 --> 20:26.810
On your feet!

20:27.890 --> 20:28.930
Five more laps!

20:34.170 --> 20:35.130
Come on, He.

20:35.650 --> 20:36.450
I'll count to three.

20:36.570 --> 20:37.690
Two, three!

20:38.610 --> 20:39.410
Watch it.

20:39.810 --> 20:40.450
One, two, three.

20:40.930 --> 20:41.490
Let's go.

20:47.050 --> 20:47.730
(I didn't know)

20:47.810 --> 20:49.210
(how Xiao Jue trained his men.)

20:50.090 --> 20:51.650
(I have finally seen it now.)

20:52.970 --> 20:54.730
(It starts so intense right away.)

20:58.010 --> 20:58.610
(Xiao Jue)

20:59.130 --> 21:00.450
(has such a pretty face,)

21:01.050 --> 21:02.130
(but he's truly vicious,)

21:02.610 --> 21:03.490
(just like before.)

21:05.090 --> 21:06.410
(I thought I could earn merits)

21:06.770 --> 21:07.610
(and rise quickly.)

21:08.410 --> 21:09.090
(But Xiao Jue)

21:09.170 --> 21:10.050
(is hard on others)

21:10.450 --> 21:11.450
(and harder on himself.)

21:15.010 --> 21:16.890
(It seems serving under him won't)

21:17.490 --> 21:18.170
(let me rise)

21:18.770 --> 21:19.730
(as easily as I hoped.)

21:23.450 --> 21:25.170
(Severely injured and then poisoned,)

21:25.770 --> 21:26.770
(in bed for a month.)

21:27.050 --> 21:28.650
(It nearly drained all my strength.)

21:29.410 --> 21:30.610
(I can't go on like this.)

21:35.890 --> 21:37.610
Commander, it's only the first day.

21:38.410 --> 21:39.930
Aren't you pushing them too hard?

21:40.570 --> 21:41.250
Mr. Shen,

21:41.850 --> 21:42.770
these recruits

21:42.970 --> 21:44.170
are either country folk

21:44.330 --> 21:45.410
or bandits and thugs.

21:45.770 --> 21:47.130
Like with that horse,

21:47.690 --> 21:49.370
the Commander's harsh methods

21:49.650 --> 21:50.290
aren't about

21:50.290 --> 21:51.290
breaking their spirit.

21:51.810 --> 21:53.490
He's testing their potential.

21:54.490 --> 21:55.330
Mr. Cheng, you know

21:55.330 --> 21:56.090
our Commander well.

21:59.010 --> 22:00.370
Isn't he the horse-taming prodigy

22:00.370 --> 22:01.290
from yesterday?

22:01.850 --> 22:02.650
Why is everyone else

22:02.650 --> 22:03.770
on their seventh lap

22:04.130 --> 22:05.370
while he started his fourth?

22:05.970 --> 22:07.010
In my opinion,

22:07.330 --> 22:08.490
he's lacking in potential.

22:08.530 --> 22:09.050
Don't speak

22:09.050 --> 22:09.930
of my savior that way.

22:10.170 --> 22:10.890
So what if he is?

22:11.410 --> 22:12.210
He could still

22:12.530 --> 22:13.730
make a good army cook.

22:14.890 --> 22:15.690
Army cook?

22:16.850 --> 22:17.770
You underestimate him.

22:19.890 --> 22:20.610
I actually think

22:21.610 --> 22:22.290
he's perfect

22:22.290 --> 22:23.610
scout material.

22:33.930 --> 22:36.610
Now we'll learn to use various weapons.

22:43.010 --> 22:43.770
I can barely stand.

22:56.210 --> 22:56.850
He,

22:57.370 --> 22:58.770
why is your sword so short?

22:59.290 --> 23:00.530
It's not even arm's length.

23:01.450 --> 23:02.370
It's twin blades.

23:02.850 --> 23:03.490
Not a sword,

23:03.970 --> 23:04.730
but a pair.

23:05.050 --> 23:06.930
W-What twin blades?

23:07.170 --> 23:09.050
Real men use this.

23:10.330 --> 23:11.170
So flashy.

23:11.210 --> 23:11.770
Exactly.

23:12.090 --> 23:13.450
Sounds like useless decoration.

23:42.090 --> 23:43.530
- Good.
- Not bad.

23:43.610 --> 23:44.410
He's got skills.

23:50.290 --> 23:51.530
That should be one technique.

23:52.370 --> 23:53.050
That's sad.

23:53.650 --> 23:54.610
He can't fight properly.

23:59.330 --> 24:00.690
I'm exhausted. Need a break.

24:14.370 --> 24:15.050
He's decent.

24:17.050 --> 24:18.130
- Good!
- Good!

24:18.690 --> 24:19.330
(Lei Hou, Yezhou Garrison recruit)
Impressive!

24:25.050 --> 24:26.210
- Good!
- Good!

24:29.130 --> 24:29.970
That's real skill.

24:36.170 --> 24:37.890
A-Are you staring or fighting?

24:38.770 --> 24:39.930
Move back. My turn first.

24:58.410 --> 24:59.050
Impressive!

24:59.130 --> 25:00.170
- Amazing!
- Amazing!

25:03.610 --> 25:04.130
Your turn.

25:05.450 --> 25:06.250
Hurry up.

25:12.690 --> 25:14.370
We're on the clock here.

25:24.930 --> 25:25.730
Draw it back.

25:25.930 --> 25:26.730
Come on.

25:29.650 --> 25:30.170
No need.

25:30.730 --> 25:31.250
I can't pull

25:31.730 --> 25:32.330
this bow.

25:36.650 --> 25:38.170
His stance looked decent.

25:41.370 --> 25:43.010
This bow requires real strength.

25:44.410 --> 25:45.410
We can't blame He Yan.

25:51.130 --> 25:51.690
He,

25:52.290 --> 25:53.290
he excels at everything.

25:53.650 --> 25:54.690
We need to work harder.

26:06.330 --> 26:06.900
Block!

26:11.810 --> 26:12.340
Retract!

26:15.290 --> 26:15.810
Again.

26:16.370 --> 26:16.950
Strike!

26:19.210 --> 26:19.740
Thrust!

26:23.010 --> 26:23.580
Block!

26:26.450 --> 26:27.100
Retract!

26:28.530 --> 26:29.170
Again.

26:30.010 --> 26:30.650
Strike!

26:32.330 --> 26:32.950
Thrust!

26:34.330 --> 26:35.060
Block!

26:59.170 --> 26:59.890
What's funny?

27:01.330 --> 27:02.770
Pick it up. Keep going.

27:07.290 --> 27:08.490
A pretty face with nothing.

27:08.810 --> 27:09.690
All show, no skill.

27:10.330 --> 27:10.970
Retract!

27:15.130 --> 27:15.970
Regardless,

27:16.210 --> 27:17.330
he picked up the spear.

27:17.610 --> 27:18.730
That's commendable.

27:22.210 --> 27:23.650
What did you find about He Yan?

27:24.130 --> 27:25.410
He's from a gatekeeper's family

27:25.450 --> 27:26.010
in Jiazhou.

27:26.610 --> 27:27.730
No prior military history.

27:28.530 --> 27:30.090
No suspicious family connections.

27:30.810 --> 27:31.410
Currently,

27:31.930 --> 27:32.970
his background checks out.

27:35.690 --> 27:37.130
Yet he's skilled in horsemanship

27:37.730 --> 27:39.610
and knows military routines well.

27:40.570 --> 27:41.610
He's clearly a seasoned

27:41.610 --> 27:42.290
soldier.

27:42.970 --> 27:43.730
But during drills,

27:44.530 --> 27:45.690
he performs pathetically.

27:46.770 --> 27:48.170
I'm quite curious.

27:49.530 --> 27:50.450
Is he faking it

27:51.330 --> 27:52.650
or truly useless?

27:56.650 --> 27:57.330
The others?

27:57.880 --> 27:58.520
Commander,

27:59.130 --> 28:00.530
recruits have diverse backgrounds.

28:00.970 --> 28:01.690
Some have

28:01.690 --> 28:02.250
dubious pasts.

28:02.730 --> 28:03.900
But the only one who faked it

28:04.650 --> 28:05.290
is this person.

28:15.410 --> 28:16.730
Send two teams from Mingshui.

28:17.290 --> 28:18.170
One to Jiazhou

28:18.690 --> 28:20.090
and one to Que City.

28:21.370 --> 28:22.970
Investigate this impostor thoroughly.

28:24.090 --> 28:24.650
The rest

28:26.050 --> 28:27.490
continue investigating in Mingshui.

28:28.450 --> 28:29.210
As you command.

28:34.190 --> 28:37.560
(Longevity of Cranes and Pines)

28:44.490 --> 28:47.130
(Song Wan, Xiao Jue's Mother)

29:51.090 --> 29:51.890
What's that smell?

29:54.970 --> 29:55.810
It seems to be

29:55.970 --> 29:57.050
from the mountain pass.

30:00.610 --> 30:01.730
The smell of sulfur?

30:03.770 --> 30:04.610
A hot spring?

30:35.410 --> 30:36.210
(But, Sister,)

30:36.610 --> 30:37.970
(the achievements you have today)

30:38.650 --> 30:39.450
are entirely due to

30:39.730 --> 30:42.210
your identity
as the He family's legitimate heir.

30:42.770 --> 30:44.250
(Even with the name He Rufei,)

30:44.450 --> 30:46.250
as a woman,

30:47.090 --> 30:47.850
how could you

30:48.290 --> 30:50.210
(achieve such accomplishments
and reputation?)

30:53.090 --> 30:54.090
(Those were all earned)

30:54.090 --> 30:55.770
(through my pain, blood, and tears.)

30:57.650 --> 30:59.010
(The He family's heir)

31:00.330 --> 31:02.290
(are just empty words.)

31:04.210 --> 31:04.850
(What's mine)

31:06.090 --> 31:07.090
(can't be taken away.)

31:22.650 --> 31:23.730
Only months have passed.

31:24.810 --> 31:26.330
But it feels like a lifetime ago.

31:28.610 --> 31:30.370
In my past life, I hid in shadows.

31:31.610 --> 31:33.570
Only the moon saw my true face.

31:36.010 --> 31:36.930
In this life,

31:38.570 --> 31:39.810
I can finally

31:40.890 --> 31:42.970
fight with honor.

31:49.130 --> 31:50.210
(With this hot spring)

31:50.890 --> 31:51.890
(and proper training,)

31:52.890 --> 31:54.090
(I should recover completely)

31:54.290 --> 31:55.090
(in a few days.)

33:06.060 --> 33:08.220
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

33:08.320 --> 33:12.240
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

33:12.420 --> 33:14.360
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

33:14.450 --> 33:19.380
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

33:31.480 --> 33:32.890
♪I've seen the mountains♪

33:33.090 --> 33:34.500
♪And trodden through ice♪

33:34.770 --> 33:37.580
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

33:37.890 --> 33:39.280
♪Destiny is my creed♪

33:39.340 --> 33:40.740
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

33:40.890 --> 33:42.680
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

33:43.880 --> 33:45.350
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

33:45.520 --> 33:46.810
♪Gazing through the mire♪

33:46.990 --> 33:49.380
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

33:49.580 --> 33:51.630
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

33:52.760 --> 33:54.590
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

33:56.550 --> 33:59.470
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

33:59.560 --> 34:02.220
♪There must always be a longing♪

34:02.680 --> 34:07.740
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

34:08.070 --> 34:10.080
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

34:10.389 --> 34:14.040
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

34:14.280 --> 34:16.170
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

34:16.199 --> 34:20.050
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

34:20.400 --> 34:22.340
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

34:22.520 --> 34:26.350
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

34:26.600 --> 34:32.350
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

34:33.239 --> 34:38.710
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

